E(264,[115,116],'C29-05','99–103','j’ignore si elle reste vraie pour un pinceau général','Vanishing-cycle conjugacy and irreducibility are deduced outside characteristic2/odd total dimension; the exceptional general-pencil case is expressly left open.','self-flagged step')
